see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_basics.vox".
see "../src/gen_expressions.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".
see "../src/gen_process.vox".
see "../src/gen_keywords.vox".

(keywords leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/keywords.md rows KEY-02, 04, 11,
 44, 45, 49, 50, 53, 54, 73. Kinds 300-306.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself, the
 same convention tests/450_gen_process_a.vox uses.)

Print "--- KEY-02: the article `the` references an existing variable ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf article the reference' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf article the reference' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- KEY-04: Set/Create declaration forms ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf set create declaration forms' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- KEY-11: Decrement, bare and `the`-prefixed ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf decrement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- KEY-44, KEY-45: the `and` subject-list terminator ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf and subject list' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- KEY-49, KEY-50: message/string as reserved aliases of text ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf reserved alias text types' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- KEY-53, KEY-54: length as a contextual keyword ---".
'rng seed' of 6.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf contextual keyword length' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- KEY-73: version as a contextual keyword (ordinary-identifier half) ---".
'rng seed' of 7.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf contextual keyword version' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- registration reachable: kinds 300-306 all dispatch without error ---".
a number called 'the kind' is 300.
While 'the kind' is less than 307,
    clear gen_out,
    'gen dispatch leaf' of 'the kind' and "" and false,
    Print "kind {'the kind'}: {gen_out's length} bytes emitted",
    Set 'the kind' to 'the kind' add 1.
